      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a great start. i really liked the part about 'erosion' and 'shaping our shared identity'. \n\ncan you expand on that a bit? like, what are some of the specific modern challenges or trends that we should mention as the main threats to this heritage? i want the mission statement to feel really urgent and clear about what we're actually fighting against.",
